te intact, and the platform release and kernel were preserved. The provider-wide restart protocol is complete for both nodes: each has a healthy pre-restart state, restart acknowledgement, changed boot identity corroborated by fixed lifecycle snapshots, and recovered service, configuration, data, and authentication behavior.","limitations":["Secret and password values were intentionally redacted, so their literal contents cannot be independently inspected; dedicated-client configuration, protected storage, matching operation, and authentication behavior provide coherent indirect confirmation."]}
